message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "nlq-validator: Lightweight Natural Language Query Validator"
abstract: >
  A lightweight Natural Language Query (NLQ) validator that keeps LLM assistants
  on-topic. Train it on example questions and it will accept in-domain queries
  while rejecting off-topic ones using TF-IDF scoring or semantic embeddings.
  Supports incremental retraining, threshold calibration, and automatic
  training-data generation via Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, Mistral, Grok, and
  Perplexity.
